WEBVTT

00:06.208 --> 00:09.541
[The following program is a true story.]

00:10.125 --> 00:12.708
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:13.291 --> 00:14.666
[True.]

00:17.041 --> 00:21.208
[2AM - Day 2 Tet]

00:26.065 --> 00:30.573
And, if you dare lay a hand
on my daughter's head,

00:30.892 --> 00:32.601
you will pay dearly.

00:33.601 --> 00:35.786
I will remind you for the last time...

00:36.987 --> 00:38.386
I will bring my daughter back.

00:39.007 --> 00:40.048
What the hell!

00:40.452 --> 00:42.632
If I wanted a man to ignore me,

00:42.832 --> 00:44.673
then I would have stayed home
with my husband!

00:45.877 --> 00:46.919
Come on.

00:47.353 --> 00:50.274
I was only following Hoa's family drama.

00:50.934 --> 00:53.213
Just wanted to know what happened to Mai.

00:53.238 --> 00:55.046
Why would you want to know at all?

00:55.879 --> 00:57.575
You have a thing for Mai?

00:57.697 --> 00:58.861
No!

00:59.509 --> 01:02.088
Get real! Mai is just a girl.

01:02.392 --> 01:03.851
She's not as tasty,

01:04.360 --> 01:05.635
or as pretty...

01:07.217 --> 01:08.638
As my Hong.

01:12.195 --> 01:13.221
Am I really tasty?

01:13.671 --> 01:14.800
Of course.

01:15.206 --> 01:16.343
If I am...

01:16.430 --> 01:17.808
then you better eat up, baby!

01:18.314 --> 01:19.689
Or you're gonna get spanked!

01:20.020 --> 01:22.443
We'll see who's getting a spanking?

02:13.708 --> 02:16.583
MISSING: EVE OF TET

02:18.291 --> 02:23.291
Episode 3: Vinh

02:26.541 --> 02:29.541
[8 AM - 1 week ago]

02:33.848 --> 02:36.518
I knew there was a feeder missing!

02:37.897 --> 02:38.810
Oh shit.

02:39.262 --> 02:41.714
You found my new stashing place.

02:43.207 --> 02:45.551
Hey! Don't tell your mother, okay?

02:45.576 --> 02:47.354
What did she yell at you for this time?

02:47.668 --> 02:48.945
Kicked by a chicken.

02:48.970 --> 02:50.095
You're cockfighting again?

02:50.120 --> 02:51.183
No...

02:51.208 --> 02:53.602
She asked me to fetch a rooster,
but he was mean!

02:53.635 --> 02:56.146
He kicked me and his spur
got me in the elbow.

02:56.672 --> 02:57.916
God...

03:01.259 --> 03:03.843
Why are you always so jinxed?

03:04.903 --> 03:06.817
She would say it's cause I'm stupid.

03:07.223 --> 03:09.223
Why do you let her treat you this way?

03:09.570 --> 03:10.945
Cause she's the smart one.

03:11.650 --> 03:13.580
The mean one is more like.

03:14.281 --> 03:15.614
But she's beautiful.

03:20.317 --> 03:21.786
Why didn't you put ointment on it?

03:22.342 --> 03:23.468
We ran out.

03:24.305 --> 03:27.441
I had planned to ask Mom for money,
but was scared she'd yell at me.

03:28.227 --> 03:30.205
Then we don't need to ask her.

03:30.339 --> 03:31.680
I can take care of it.

03:32.046 --> 03:32.796
Hand...

03:33.477 --> 03:34.528
I forgot!

03:34.823 --> 03:36.484
You're a doctor now.

03:36.509 --> 03:39.287
I wish! I'm just a pharmacist.

03:39.312 --> 03:40.640
I haven't even finished school yet.

03:40.665 --> 03:43.165
I'll clean your wound
when we get back down.

03:43.821 --> 03:45.554
I'm so proud of my girl.

03:45.891 --> 03:47.096
Such a good person.

03:47.574 --> 03:49.391
With your mother's smarts.

03:49.717 --> 03:50.794
Sure about that?

03:50.977 --> 03:54.477
If I was as smart as you say,
then I'd still be in school.

03:56.347 --> 03:57.888
You're just back to celebrate Tet.

03:59.509 --> 04:01.509
After Tet I'll go back
to missing you again.

04:08.051 --> 04:10.208
Afterwards,
you will go back to school, right?

04:10.717 --> 04:11.294
Huh?

04:18.055 --> 04:21.263
This is like pure alcohol.
You can't drink this.

04:22.379 --> 04:23.379
How can you drink this?

04:23.688 --> 04:25.722
I was going to steep some plums.

04:25.747 --> 04:28.357
But I got lazy and just drank it.

04:30.347 --> 04:31.388
Give me your hand.

04:32.217 --> 04:33.259
What are you gonna do?

04:33.957 --> 04:34.998
Disinfect.

04:35.362 --> 04:36.592
It's a shame to waste this!

04:39.224 --> 04:41.857
Calm down. Calm down.
It just stings for a bit.

04:42.467 --> 04:43.467
Just a bit longer.

04:43.842 --> 04:45.336
Are you trying to kill me?

04:45.967 --> 04:47.812
You're trying to kill me, right?

05:02.253 --> 05:03.427
When I'm gone...

05:05.894 --> 05:07.219
Who will look after you then?

05:43.759 --> 05:48.759
[11 PM - New Year’s Day]

05:53.309 --> 05:54.509
Who's there?

06:10.509 --> 06:12.173
There's no drugs or money here!

06:13.137 --> 06:14.045
What do you want?

06:14.769 --> 06:16.881
I want to help you find Mai.

06:19.967 --> 06:21.259
How would you do that?

06:23.778 --> 06:26.164
Folks around here are scared
of talking to cops.

06:26.498 --> 06:27.790
If you want the dirt,

06:27.933 --> 06:29.522
then ask the junkies.

06:33.763 --> 06:34.869
What do you want for it?

06:35.690 --> 06:37.288
Hoa said that she would pay.

06:37.433 --> 06:39.041
How much would you pay me?

07:36.384 --> 07:37.480
Who's there?

07:41.509 --> 07:42.649
Are you talking to me?

07:45.466 --> 07:46.524
Not at all.

07:46.549 --> 07:47.878
Thought you were asleep.

07:50.217 --> 07:53.191
Uh... I was fixing
the heat lamp for the chicks.

07:58.717 --> 07:59.634
You should get some rest.

08:11.176 --> 08:12.153
Hey.

08:12.539 --> 08:14.766
Do you hear a beeping sound, too?

08:15.222 --> 08:17.504
It's like someone...

08:18.980 --> 08:20.433
God.

08:59.008 --> 09:02.258
Getting high without sharing...
Will make your needles brittle.

09:03.217 --> 09:05.551
Do I look like I have
enough to share?

09:09.426 --> 09:10.632
Where's your wife?

09:11.822 --> 09:13.695
Went to get more smack.

09:14.914 --> 09:17.088
Are we, uh...
Celebrating something?

09:18.259 --> 09:20.101
Celebrate, my ass!

09:21.216 --> 09:22.970
That fucker, Co.

09:23.149 --> 09:24.732
He fucked us.

09:25.738 --> 09:27.404
He won't pay.

09:28.263 --> 09:30.555
Now I'm stuck with the girl.

09:31.509 --> 09:32.525
This time...

09:33.070 --> 09:34.445
You and me...

09:35.008 --> 09:36.341
Will be going away...

09:36.691 --> 09:37.969
For a long time.

09:39.759 --> 09:41.505
I'm the lucky guy

09:42.677 --> 09:44.480
who has come to save you.

09:53.144 --> 09:54.810
You think her fucking Mom...

09:55.079 --> 09:57.822
Would let her idiot husband pay you?

09:58.981 --> 10:01.253
Just get the girl back to her,

10:01.551 --> 10:03.051
and she'll pay us the money.

10:03.524 --> 10:05.982
The husband will convince her.

10:08.467 --> 10:10.134
You're not useless after all.

10:17.769 --> 10:20.251
This message is for the animals
who kidnapped my daughter.

10:20.929 --> 10:25.066
Right now... The cops are
in there to protect me.

10:25.589 --> 10:28.661
Out there, a thousand other cops,
are out there looking for her.

10:28.774 --> 10:30.509
You want your ransom?

10:30.946 --> 10:32.661
I have a better idea.

10:33.380 --> 10:36.058
Return her to me this instant.

10:36.646 --> 10:41.491
There's no place in this world
for you assholes to hide.

10:41.563 --> 10:42.759
I swear...

10:42.933 --> 10:44.724
You will all hang.

10:46.683 --> 10:48.956
Give my daughter back unharmed.

10:49.384 --> 10:50.634
Otherwise...

10:51.263 --> 10:53.089
I'll tell them to execute you all.

10:53.774 --> 10:54.982
Moreover,

10:55.310 --> 10:56.950
I am telling you...

10:56.975 --> 10:59.656
If you harm one hair on
my daughter's head.

10:59.739 --> 11:01.506
I will make you all pay!

11:01.938 --> 11:03.207
Fucking bitch!

11:04.747 --> 11:06.206
What are you gonna do?

11:07.677 --> 11:09.505
I will show her daughter,

11:09.530 --> 11:10.988
what an animal looks like.

11:15.976 --> 11:16.831
You...

11:19.654 --> 11:21.132
Damn it!

11:25.384 --> 11:26.772
Fuck you!

11:30.695 --> 11:32.320
For the last time.

11:32.776 --> 11:35.994
Return my daughter unharmed,

11:37.035 --> 11:38.816
and I will as the court to forgive you.

11:38.841 --> 11:40.945
But if you fail to do so,

11:41.426 --> 11:45.426
then they will blow all your brains out,
you filthy, fucking animals.

11:45.904 --> 11:48.214
Why did you say all those things, Mother?

11:49.519 --> 11:50.685
Oh God...

11:52.933 --> 11:55.224
The kidnappers have our daughter.

11:55.631 --> 11:58.353
You do this,
you're gonna kill your daughter!

11:58.378 --> 12:00.169
You're provoking them.

12:02.222 --> 12:03.336
Tell me, then...

12:04.134 --> 12:06.134
Where will we find the ransom money?

12:07.479 --> 12:09.062
I've tried to pawn the house,

12:09.691 --> 12:11.274
no one will buy it.

12:12.849 --> 12:14.037
We may not need to.

12:14.717 --> 12:17.055
I made a deal with Bau.

12:17.592 --> 12:18.259
What?

12:19.190 --> 12:23.109
He said give him 50 mill,
and he'll bring Mai back to us.

12:23.258 --> 12:24.440
Bau?

12:25.188 --> 12:27.438
You would take the word of that junkie?

12:28.672 --> 12:31.647
If you believe him
then I have nothing left to say to you.

12:32.107 --> 12:34.077
But what he said made sense.

12:34.247 --> 12:37.869
Only a criminal would know
what the criminals want.

12:38.127 --> 12:39.520
- Please, believe...
- Shut your damn mouth!

12:39.552 --> 12:42.148
You give him one dime,
and I will break your legs!

12:45.926 --> 12:49.926
[1 AM- Day 2 Tet]

13:08.150 --> 13:08.900
Dan!

13:09.189 --> 13:10.360
What have you done?

13:10.623 --> 13:11.717
Where are her pants?

13:11.742 --> 13:12.909
Where's my smack?

13:13.074 --> 13:14.483
You raped a child...

13:14.508 --> 13:15.966
And you dare ask for more drugs?

13:15.991 --> 13:17.187
Damn!

13:18.840 --> 13:19.982
Where's my smack?

13:21.342 --> 13:22.292
Fuck!

13:22.763 --> 13:23.834
You!

13:24.935 --> 13:25.894
Pick it up!

13:27.176 --> 13:28.205
Do it yourself.

13:28.230 --> 13:29.230
Pick it up!

13:31.969 --> 13:32.715
Bitch.

13:32.885 --> 13:34.293
Hurry. Stand up!

13:34.318 --> 13:35.401
You bitch!

13:35.426 --> 13:37.803
You dare talk back to me? Fuck you!

13:38.641 --> 13:40.011
You dare talk back to me?

13:40.779 --> 13:42.470
- I'm sorry...
- You're sorry?

13:43.438 --> 13:44.746
Didn't you hear me?

13:45.051 --> 13:45.899
Fuck you...

13:45.988 --> 13:47.888
You dare talk back to me? Fuck you!

13:48.663 --> 13:50.168
You don't obey me, right?

13:50.266 --> 13:52.108
Do you want like her? Fuck you.

13:52.133 --> 13:54.412
Please stop hitting me!

13:54.735 --> 13:55.938
Do you dare to criticize me?

13:57.141 --> 13:58.746
Please, I'm sorry!

14:43.703 --> 14:44.818
Obey me!

14:44.843 --> 14:45.891
I'm sorry.

14:46.041 --> 14:47.380
I'm sorry.

14:54.274 --> 14:56.493
Stay here! Where do you go?

14:57.391 --> 14:58.271
Where do you go?

16:36.346 --> 16:37.781
What Happened?

16:37.806 --> 16:39.055
[8 AM - 1 year ago]

16:39.165 --> 16:40.590
I was careless

16:40.688 --> 16:41.938
then I fell.

16:44.299 --> 16:45.113
Dad.

16:45.665 --> 16:47.421
Do you think Mom will believe...

16:47.446 --> 16:49.153
that it was an accident?

16:53.344 --> 16:55.344
She's gonna bite my head off.

16:56.009 --> 16:58.118
At least you weren't injured.

17:12.060 --> 17:13.185
Take your jacket off.

17:13.342 --> 17:14.018
What?

17:27.328 --> 17:28.209
Here!

17:29.592 --> 17:30.974
Shouldn't you use a bandaid?

17:30.999 --> 17:34.082
Ah, no. The sticker is for your bike.

17:34.575 --> 17:37.159
This here... This is for you
to patch yourself up.

17:40.214 --> 17:41.032
Hey...

17:41.057 --> 17:42.180
If mom asks,

17:42.205 --> 17:44.269
Then tell her we customized the bike,

17:44.293 --> 17:46.526
so that everyone knows
that this is Mai's bike.

17:46.551 --> 17:47.387
Cool?

18:05.134 --> 18:09.634
[8 AM - Day 2 Tet]

18:09.842 --> 18:11.301
It rolled down from here,

18:11.467 --> 18:13.719
then it sank and disappeared under.

18:15.195 --> 18:16.870
- Back, everyone!
- Please let us through.

18:16.895 --> 18:19.373
- Let me through, my daughter is in there!
- That is my daughter!

18:19.391 --> 18:21.695
Where is my daughter? Long? Long!

18:21.926 --> 18:23.075
- Long!
- Long!

18:25.709 --> 18:27.292
Our daughter is in there!

18:27.317 --> 18:29.030
Let me through, my daughter is in there!

18:29.055 --> 18:30.651
- Our daughter is the victim
- Long! Long!

18:30.676 --> 18:32.157
Long! Long!

18:32.238 --> 18:33.352
Let them through.

18:34.060 --> 18:35.272
Auntie. Uncle.

18:35.438 --> 18:37.423
- You found Mai? Where is she?
- Where is Mai?

18:37.448 --> 18:39.658
- Where is Mai?
- Is she alive?

18:39.683 --> 18:40.539
Where is Mai?

18:40.564 --> 18:42.600
- She isn't in there!
- Then where did she go?

18:42.625 --> 18:44.984
- Where is she?
- Phao only found her bike!

18:45.009 --> 18:47.092
- Where is Mai?
- Then that Phao is responsible, isn't he?

18:47.117 --> 18:49.117
No, he's not. Auntie...
Auntie, let hear me.

18:49.812 --> 18:50.697
Auntie...

18:59.144 --> 18:59.895
Auntie!

19:03.255 --> 19:06.351
It's your fault! You didn't look for her!

19:06.376 --> 19:07.673
Long! It's your fault!

19:11.547 --> 19:12.950
Where is our daughter?

19:13.437 --> 19:15.437
Where is she?

19:37.134 --> 19:41.824
In a surprise development, just hours
after the victim's mother...

19:41.849 --> 19:46.373
Miss D.T.H. live-streamed and threatened
the kidnappers to release her daughter.

19:46.398 --> 19:48.981
If not, she intends to capture them...

19:51.176 --> 19:52.250
You bitch!

19:57.485 --> 19:58.817
Damn it!

20:10.751 --> 20:12.071
Fuck you!

20:46.183 --> 20:47.707
Dad...

20:51.915 --> 20:53.255
Dad...

20:56.669 --> 20:57.968
Dad...

21:16.265 --> 21:17.351
What is it?

21:17.738 --> 21:18.864
Nothing.

21:21.371 --> 21:24.253
Why did you insist on driving us home?

21:24.442 --> 21:26.151
Why aren't you interrogating Phao?

21:26.279 --> 21:28.684
Auntie... this is a kidnapping case.

21:28.979 --> 21:32.531
My superiors have ordered that your home and
the whole family be placed under police protection.

21:32.556 --> 21:33.556
Protection?

21:33.581 --> 21:36.164
I feel like a criminal
constantly being followed.

21:37.217 --> 21:39.301
Just let them do their job, Mother.

21:45.509 --> 21:46.259
Uncle.

21:47.717 --> 21:48.833
Please help me.

21:49.104 --> 21:50.745
Keep her off the livestream.

21:59.775 --> 22:01.064
Let's go.

22:11.547 --> 22:12.450
My god...

22:12.688 --> 22:15.248
They dropped the bike into the lake
to wash off their DNA!

22:15.609 --> 22:16.609
Clever!

22:16.634 --> 22:18.634
You are so easily led.

22:18.801 --> 22:20.013
What do you mean?

22:20.324 --> 22:22.242
We are tracking the phone, correct?

22:22.422 --> 22:25.585
For example, let's say here is
where we tracked their signal...

22:25.610 --> 22:29.026
This is where they threw the bike.
We'll use this cup for the bike.

22:29.509 --> 22:31.009
Then what we...
Where are you going?

22:31.884 --> 22:32.951
Uh...

22:33.148 --> 22:34.924
I wasn't going anywhere.

22:35.276 --> 22:37.442
If not, then why are you at the door?

22:37.467 --> 22:38.301
Come inside.

22:44.092 --> 22:45.602
You called the cops here?

22:49.509 --> 22:50.894
You have my money?

22:51.956 --> 22:54.267
But do you know... Where Mai is?

22:55.634 --> 22:57.176
You want to see her face again?

23:05.384 --> 23:06.217
Follow me.

23:08.207 --> 23:10.357
How can you be sure the
culprit is not female?

23:10.382 --> 23:14.501
Because a female criminal would
never kidnap a young girl.

23:14.526 --> 23:16.876
Just yesterday you were
so sure it was a female!

23:16.901 --> 23:18.026
Oh kill me already!

23:18.051 --> 23:21.067
What are you doing? I'm speculating!
Don't look at me with those bulging!

23:21.092 --> 23:22.018
Like you wanna kill me!

23:22.043 --> 23:22.817
Idiots!

23:22.842 --> 23:23.596
You...

23:25.198 --> 23:26.404
What did you say?

23:27.134 --> 23:27.884
He... Uh...

23:28.402 --> 23:29.902
What I mean is...

23:30.706 --> 23:32.429
Where did my youngest go?

23:32.763 --> 23:35.103
Ah, Hanh went over to Tien's.

23:35.316 --> 23:37.041
She's making lunch.

23:37.993 --> 23:39.868
Can I go over there?

23:43.121 --> 23:44.496
Over to Long's?

23:46.064 --> 23:46.933
Sure.

23:47.221 --> 23:48.236
Go then.

23:51.467 --> 23:53.250
Let me braid your hair.

23:54.051 --> 23:56.546
When will Mai return?

23:56.823 --> 23:58.552
She will return soon.

23:59.298 --> 24:01.526
Sit still, so I could tie your hair.

24:01.551 --> 24:02.551
Okay...

24:29.399 --> 24:30.566
What the fuck is this?

24:30.591 --> 24:32.368
Fuck your bags of rice.

24:32.529 --> 24:34.570
This is the new way to move product!

24:37.759 --> 24:39.184
You called me here...

24:39.238 --> 24:40.650
for this shit?

24:42.496 --> 24:43.979
Don't be hasty.

24:47.857 --> 24:49.716
Tell your suppliers,

24:49.741 --> 24:51.116
Send me 200 million...

24:51.141 --> 24:54.614
And I'll move 2 billion in product
for them. Immediate. Clean. Speedy!

24:57.197 --> 24:59.469
You need to get out of these woods.

25:01.602 --> 25:02.828
Up here,

25:03.113 --> 25:04.579
who doesn't buy coals?

25:04.954 --> 25:07.228
Cops would never suspect it, believe me!

25:07.490 --> 25:08.740
I tried it!

25:21.595 --> 25:25.358
Are you using an old number?
Did the cops confiscated your new phone?

25:25.597 --> 25:28.347
I've tried everything,
but still can't get 500 mil.

25:28.739 --> 25:30.538
I even tried to morgage,
but still not enough!

25:30.727 --> 25:33.386
What do I have to do
to get my daughter back?

25:33.801 --> 25:34.637
300 mill.

25:34.692 --> 25:35.567
50.

25:35.817 --> 25:36.567
200.

25:36.817 --> 25:37.567
50.

25:37.701 --> 25:38.866
100. Final offer.

25:38.891 --> 25:40.094
You get your girl back.

25:40.118 --> 25:41.462
I get my life back.

25:41.740 --> 25:43.697
Okay, 100 it is...

25:53.154 --> 25:54.908
Your number...

26:10.592 --> 26:11.919
Mom?

26:31.755 --> 26:32.755
Where are we?

26:33.363 --> 26:34.779
Why did you take me here?

26:37.563 --> 26:38.648
Trust me.

27:08.106 --> 27:09.361
Here, Mr. Vinh.

27:18.967 --> 27:19.997
Where's Mai?

27:20.528 --> 27:22.491
You said you were taking me to find her!

27:23.485 --> 27:25.673
Is this the chicken cage that was
on the back of Mai's bike, right?

27:25.802 --> 27:26.885
Yes.

27:27.060 --> 27:28.703
Maybe the kidnappers...

27:30.027 --> 27:31.860
Took her across the border.

27:36.589 --> 27:37.541
That's not true!

27:38.362 --> 27:42.016
They found her motorbike this morning...
In the lake, on the outskirts of town!

27:42.801 --> 27:43.842
Are you trying to trick me?

27:45.759 --> 27:47.127
My wife is right.

27:48.426 --> 27:50.069
Never trust a word of a junkie!

27:50.467 --> 27:51.426
Vinh!

27:53.138 --> 27:54.263
Don't you want this cage?

27:54.676 --> 27:55.381
No.

27:56.177 --> 27:57.761
I want to see my daughter!

27:59.579 --> 28:02.162
I beg you, let me see my daughter.

28:04.355 --> 28:05.896
Let me see my daughter!

28:13.056 --> 28:16.795
[7:30PM - Day 2 Tet]

28:16.820 --> 28:18.004
You fucker!

28:18.878 --> 28:21.260
- Why are you home so late?
- Happy New Year!

28:21.285 --> 28:22.576
Where's my lucky money?

28:23.140 --> 28:25.779
Either pay up or drink up!

28:29.997 --> 28:31.408
You brought them here?

28:32.870 --> 28:34.332
What kind of question is that?

28:35.175 --> 28:37.244
Aren't you happy to see us?

28:38.294 --> 28:40.331
You should be like your wife.

28:41.746 --> 28:42.746
Drink.

28:44.342 --> 28:45.134
You!

28:50.415 --> 28:51.415
Leave.

28:55.445 --> 28:57.081
You guys enjoy.

28:57.106 --> 28:58.872
I need a word with him.

29:00.771 --> 29:02.949
Better not take our lucky money.

29:04.134 --> 29:05.926
We were here first.

29:09.410 --> 29:12.551
No, no, no. I wouldn't dare!

29:12.576 --> 29:14.308
Come, come, come...

29:22.511 --> 29:24.517
I can get you the 50 mil.

29:24.542 --> 29:26.909
Keep your word. Release the girl, okay?

29:31.697 --> 29:32.741
100.

29:32.997 --> 29:34.331
What?

29:34.589 --> 29:36.069
We had a deal.

29:36.094 --> 29:37.427
You can't just ask for double!

29:37.568 --> 29:38.639
Hey!

29:39.467 --> 29:40.467
Hey...

29:43.554 --> 29:44.892
What did I tell you?

29:45.511 --> 29:46.844
You go over my head.

29:46.869 --> 29:48.984
I'll slash your neck. Got it?

29:49.509 --> 29:52.151
I'm not gonna do that.

29:52.224 --> 29:53.712
I prefer the belly.

29:54.305 --> 29:55.723
Just watch yourself.

29:56.176 --> 29:57.532
I was kidding!

30:01.384 --> 30:02.694
Be reasonable.

30:03.092 --> 30:04.676
We had agreed on 50.

30:05.812 --> 30:07.591
50 was for snatching the girl.

30:08.019 --> 30:09.612
50 for room and board.

30:09.844 --> 30:11.584
This ain't a temple.

30:11.763 --> 30:13.097
It's not free.

30:13.867 --> 30:16.450
Or do you want them
to come over to your place?

30:24.542 --> 30:25.417
Fine.

30:26.509 --> 30:27.707
This is the last time.

30:28.634 --> 30:30.467
I'm not paying more.

30:43.566 --> 30:45.067
Where's your boss?

30:45.092 --> 30:46.259
Taking a piss.

31:09.685 --> 31:10.685
Tasty.

31:17.285 --> 31:19.201
Boys! Get in here!

31:19.233 --> 31:22.067
- A treat? Must be nice!
- Good meat?

31:22.133 --> 31:23.150
Get in!

31:23.174 --> 31:24.101
Going!

31:28.255 --> 31:29.871
Remember, honey.

31:30.211 --> 31:33.300
You have to promise to
keep this secret for me.

31:33.842 --> 31:35.400
If you tell anyone,

31:35.592 --> 31:37.467
they will hurt your sister.

31:37.967 --> 31:40.092
They even said if we tell the police,

31:40.426 --> 31:42.426
they will kill Mai.

31:43.094 --> 31:44.352
So...

31:44.753 --> 31:46.294
If we do what they say,

31:46.560 --> 31:49.088
then they will let Mai go, right mom?

31:51.219 --> 31:52.427
That's why...

31:53.117 --> 31:55.487
I need your help to get the money.

32:02.551 --> 32:03.967
Can you help me?

32:08.293 --> 32:11.293
It is 8pm Day 2 of Tet,

32:11.802 --> 32:13.969
I know that everyone is celebrating...

32:14.160 --> 32:16.160
with their family for Tet.

32:16.709 --> 32:19.033
I want to ask for
just a few minutes of your time.

32:25.342 --> 32:26.342
Sir.

32:27.430 --> 32:28.347
Sir!

32:29.730 --> 32:31.563
Hoa is live streaming again!

32:33.043 --> 32:34.706
I've tried to get a loan,

32:35.092 --> 32:36.097
to pawn...

32:37.134 --> 32:39.051
even tried to sell the deed to my house.

32:39.926 --> 32:42.426
To find enough... To save Mai.

32:42.957 --> 32:44.248
But it's Tet!

32:45.488 --> 32:49.049
No one was willing to lend
or buy anything.

32:49.074 --> 32:50.803
Cause you're a shitty person!

32:51.115 --> 32:52.899
It's your turn!

32:53.490 --> 32:56.115
We are running out of hope,

32:57.217 --> 32:59.342
with each hour that passes...

32:59.735 --> 33:02.360
Our daughter's life is in greater danger.

33:04.385 --> 33:06.940
Our family need your support.

33:06.965 --> 33:08.449
We're not looking for handouts.

33:08.473 --> 33:09.940
I'm willing to pawn my house

33:10.143 --> 33:11.473
to get the money...

33:11.497 --> 33:12.893
to save my daughter.

33:12.918 --> 33:13.670
Vinh!

33:15.801 --> 33:17.802
Thank you, officer.
We're going home now.

33:17.827 --> 33:18.846
Yes.

33:19.024 --> 33:20.155
Let's go.

33:21.011 --> 33:23.651
I told you not to fool around
with that woman anymore!

33:23.676 --> 33:25.759
Pull up those baggy pants!

33:25.784 --> 33:27.151
Look at that shirt...

33:27.176 --> 33:29.070
To the kidnappers,

33:30.551 --> 33:33.884
I am going to honor your demand.

33:35.676 --> 33:38.426
But please, give me more time.

33:39.467 --> 33:40.979
Please show mercy,

33:41.259 --> 33:43.801
Don't harm my daughter.

33:47.446 --> 33:50.719
For those who care for Mai...
And for my family.

33:52.125 --> 33:54.250
I'm leaving my information
at the bottom of the screen.

33:55.842 --> 33:58.259
Thank you for all your support.

34:01.683 --> 34:02.806
Mom...

34:02.831 --> 34:04.831
A lot of people want to help!

34:14.417 --> 34:15.851
Why did you let him go?

34:16.005 --> 34:19.270
He knew where the cage was hidden.
I'm certain that he's one of them!

34:19.812 --> 34:21.709
If he's one of them,

34:22.316 --> 34:24.232
why would he show me a cage?

34:24.735 --> 34:27.276
He just wants the money, like you said.

34:27.301 --> 34:30.493
Never mind that! The cage must connect
back to the kidnappers!

34:30.842 --> 34:32.026
Arrest them!

34:32.051 --> 34:34.500
Alright. If there's any information,

34:34.525 --> 34:36.152
I will let you know right away!

34:36.177 --> 34:36.969
Don't worry.

34:37.426 --> 34:38.092
Okay then.

34:38.259 --> 34:39.467
Take the cage.

34:40.467 --> 34:41.421
You...

34:41.759 --> 34:43.266
Do something useful.

34:43.592 --> 34:44.676
Stay with Hanh.

34:57.009 --> 35:00.009
[4PM - 2 days before Tet]

35:02.903 --> 35:04.278
Stop it, dad.

35:04.734 --> 35:06.067
If you keep helping,

35:06.092 --> 35:08.916
we won't have any more stars left.

35:08.941 --> 35:11.816
Forget it. I'm useless at
these delicate things.

35:12.103 --> 35:13.675
How can you say that?

35:14.276 --> 35:16.067
We wouldn't gotten the idea
to make these things...

35:16.092 --> 35:18.967
- If you hadn't suggested it.
- What did I suggest?

35:19.217 --> 35:21.651
I just complimented you two
on the one you made.

35:21.676 --> 35:24.317
But you bought all these materials!

35:24.342 --> 35:27.401
From the rubber bands to
the stars, even the ribbons.

35:27.628 --> 35:29.669
With my money!

35:29.817 --> 35:31.276
Yes, boss-lady.

35:31.318 --> 35:32.636
Back to work!

35:32.661 --> 35:33.786
Not me. I was fired...

35:33.811 --> 35:34.453
Dad!

35:34.477 --> 35:35.558
What now?

35:35.583 --> 35:36.779
Sit down.

35:37.036 --> 35:38.827
I know something that you can do.

35:42.485 --> 35:43.658
Give me a second.

35:45.889 --> 35:47.243
You can be our model!

35:47.792 --> 35:51.493
No way! I want views on our website!

35:51.603 --> 35:53.260
Fine, I'll post it on my account!

35:53.572 --> 35:55.405
Hanh! Come here!

35:56.451 --> 35:57.930
Quickly!

35:59.112 --> 35:59.820
One.

35:59.845 --> 36:00.578
Two.

36:00.603 --> 36:01.372
Three!

36:05.353 --> 36:08.936
[10PM - Day 2 Tet]

37:13.103 --> 37:17.423
Don't scream! Don't scream!
I'm not going to hurt you. Don't scream.

37:17.462 --> 37:19.678
I talked with your father, Vinh, already!

37:22.535 --> 37:23.928
I'm taking you home.

37:25.397 --> 37:27.160
I already told your father.

37:29.428 --> 37:30.810
Do you still have the strength?

37:32.217 --> 37:34.100
Stand up.

37:35.771 --> 37:37.760
Leave some strength to go home.

37:38.348 --> 37:39.418
Leave?

37:39.625 --> 37:40.750
Dan!

37:45.439 --> 37:46.856
Where are you taking her?

37:47.725 --> 37:50.763
B...bring her b...back to her father...

37:51.033 --> 37:53.617
He agreed t-to pay us 50 mil.

37:53.712 --> 37:55.208
He promised.

37:55.585 --> 37:57.646
- Promised?
- Yes.

37:57.962 --> 37:59.588
Co told me...

37:59.808 --> 38:02.744
Her mother agreed to pay 100 mil!

38:02.769 --> 38:03.916
Fuck...

38:05.239 --> 38:06.509
G...good right?

38:07.751 --> 38:09.069
Something happened.

38:12.040 --> 38:13.936
I can't let her go now.

38:50.487 --> 38:52.300
MISSING: EVE OF TET
